; d3dx9_43.dll proxy export forwarders.
; AUTO-GENERATED by build_def.py from the genuine d3dx9_43.dll export table.
; The 319 forwarders below reach the renamed genuine library staged next to the
; game exe as d3dx9_43_real.dll (CheatStager stages it). The loader resolves
; these forwarders itself, so the game's d3dx9 calls reach the real lib with
; ZERO hand-written stubs -> no missing-export crash.
;
; The 10 TRIGGER exports below are NOT here on purpose — they are REAL C
; trampolines in proxy.c that start the cheat engine on first call (idempotent)
; then forward to d3dx9_43_real.<Name> themselves:
;     D3DXCompileShader
;     D3DXCreateTexture
;     D3DXGetShaderConstantTable
;     D3DXMatrixInverse
;     D3DXMatrixMultiply
;     D3DXMatrixRotationY
;     D3DXMatrixTranslation
;     D3DXMatrixTranspose
;     D3DXVec3Normalize
;     D3DXVec3TransformCoord
; A name is EITHER a real export OR a forwarder, never both — listing them here
; too would be a duplicate-symbol link error. Regenerate by editing/refreshing
; d3dx9_43_real_src.def then running: python build_def.py
;
; WHY START FROM AN EXPORT (device-diagnosed): on this arm64ec Wine/FEX stack
; the loader MAPS a native x86_64 DLL and thunks its exports on demand but does
; NOT call its DllMain — so the engine must bootstrap from a function the game
; actually CALLS, not from DllMain. See proxy.c's BREAKTHROUGH REDESIGN note.
;
; NO `LIBRARY d3dx9_43.dll` line here on purpose (internal name comes from the
; output filename). GnCheatEngineMarker is a harmless real marker export.
;
; The proxy is linked CRT-FREE so libc binds to Wine-builtin msvcrt.dll:
;   x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc -shared -O2 -s -nostartfiles -e DllMain \
;       -nodefaultlibs -o d3dx9_43.dll proxy.c cheat.c d3dx9_43.def \
;       -lmsvcrt-os -lkernel32
; (-lmsvcrt-os, NOT -lmsvcrt; see README.md + crt_msvcrt_shim.h.)
EXPORTS
D3DXAssembleShader=d3dx9_43_real.D3DXAssembleShader
D3DXAssembleShaderFromFileA=d3dx9_43_real.D3DXAssembleShaderFromFileA
D3DXAssembleShaderFromFileW=d3dx9_43_real.D3DXAssembleShaderFromFileW
